{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e74c21f4-22bf-859a-8f50-bfc00988d0bb",
  "created_at": "2025-12-15T09:51:29-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Richard Lawton",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T09:48:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T09:48:52-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's still there, the water at the curb. I called about my mother's street before, no, wait, I didn't, my sister did. Anyway, it's out front of the house and nobody's come."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T09:49:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, let me back up a little. What's the address where you're seeing the water?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T09:49:09-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "327 Admiral Kalbfus Road. Up in the North End. It's my mother's house, I'm the one calling for her because she doesn't do the phone much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T09:49:18-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 327 Admiral Kalbfus. And is this from a storm, or is it just sitting there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T09:49:24-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No storm. Nothing. It's been dry for days. That's what gets me. It's meltwater, from the snow pile, and it just ponds up at the curb because the drain doesn't take it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T09:49:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the drain's not taking anything. How deep are we talking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T09:49:39-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Up to the hubcaps on my car. I parked there Saturday and I about had to wade. And then at night it freezes, so in the morning it's black ice all across the bottom of the driveway and the sidewalk. Somebody's going to go down on it. My mother walks out there to get the paper."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T09:49:57-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's a real hazard, I understand. What you want is the drain cleaned out, is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T09:50:04-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Cleaned. Cleared, whatever you call it. Somebody has to come and clean that drain. I shouldn't have to keep calling about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T09:50:12-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll put in a work order for a crew to look at the catch basin in front of 327. Is there a cross street or anything near it so they find the right one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T09:50:24-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's, hold on. [pause] Sorry, my phone's doing that thing again. The camera app opens up every time I put it in my pocket. I've got a picture of the whole mess on here somewhere and now it's the camera again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T09:50:38-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right, you don't need the picture for me. Just the address is plenty. The drain's right at the curb out front?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T09:50:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right at the curb, in front of the house. Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T09:50:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Do you want a call back when it's scheduled? What's a good number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T09:50:55-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0189. That's the landline, I'm at my own place but it's the one I answer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T09:51:01-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0189. I've got it down. In the meantime, if there's sand or salt around, a little on that ice would help your mother out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T09:51:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll bring some over this afternoon. But please, get somebody out there soon. It freezes every single night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T09:51:16-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll mark it as an ice hazard so it gets looked at quickly. Somebody should be there in the next few days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T09:51:24-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Thank you, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T09:51:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Lawton. Take care."
    }
  ],
